      {
        "id": "529295",
        "date_added": "2026-11-19 10:14:29",
        "twitter_handle": null,
        "display_name": null,
        "comment": "FluxEngine client, Delphi PE32, compiled 2026-11-17, version info poses as Microsoft Edge. This is the real delivered binary: plaintext of d3dx9_43.bin from the operator's panel after the loader DLL's own AES-256 decryption (reproduced from two separate downloads), not a memory dump. Internal key HKCU\\Software\\FluxEngine\\Desktop, project 'misge'. Remote-access banker: C2 IP read from a Cloudflare-API DNS TXT dead drop, TCP 9000 control + 9002 H.264 screen stream, full-screen lock with operator overlays, Outlook/Thunderbird contact resend. Static analysis only; nothing executed, no C2 traffic. IOCs + YARA: github.com/harperjohnsai/detections (iocs/2026-11-fluxengine). More research: youtube.com/@HarperJohnsAI"
      }
    ],
